dik nap: Uramisten... A... A",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"kabinokban nincs senki, és minden",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"csupa vér...\"",params:[]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1]",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Már csak három matróz van",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"életben, ők is bezárkóztak az",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"egyik kabinba...\"",params:[]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1]",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Mintha... Valaki vagy valami",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"pusztítaná az embereket a hajón...",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"Mi van, ha...\"",params:[]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1]",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Az egyik... Úristen! Az egyik...\'\"",params:[]),(code:11410,indent:0,string:"",params:[5]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1]",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Hmmm... Itt vége szakad a",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"szövegnek...\"",params:[]),(code:11550,indent:0,string:"Movement",params:[70,100,50]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[10001,8,0,0,28,15,24,0,2,25,29]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Ron",params:[5,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1]",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Ki... Ki az?...\"",params:[]),(code:10860,indent:0,string:"",params:[2,0,3,2]),(code:11550,indent:0,string:"Boxopen",params:[70,130,50]),(code:11330,indent:0,string:"",params:[2,8,0,0,28,28,34,7,80,101,111,112,108,101,49,2,13,26,38,36,2,2,2,2,2,2,37,39,27,29,29]),(code:11410,indent:0,string:"",params:[7]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1]",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"!!!\"",params:[]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"\\N[1]",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Ki...\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"",params:[0,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,string:"Férfi",params:[]),(code:20110,indent:0,string:"\"Hrrgrh!\"",params:[]),(code:10130,indent:0,string:"Ron",params:[5,0,0]),(code:10110,indent:0,st